    </item>
    <item>
      <title>1.11.0</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 18:05:12 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>154</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.11.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[Your machines, from anywhere.

• Open a terminal on any Mac or Linux machine, from the app or your iPhone.
• See and control a Mac's screen — it wakes its own display when you connect.
• Linux machines now have a desktop you can step into, even with nobody logged in.
• Screens: a live view of everything you own, in one place.
• Connections are steadier on networks that block devices from talking to each other.]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/thecloudstation/connect-releases/releases/download/v1.11.0/CloudStationConnect-1.11.0.zip"
                 length="33981862"
                 type="application/octet-stream"
